 "explanations": {
  "engine ignores GTFS pickup_type/drop_off_type = 1": "The conn_*.bin files have no pickup or drop-off flags, so the engine lets a rider board where the feed says the bus picks nobody up. The reference honors the flags; rerun with the flags ignored it equals the engine on every one of these queries. All cases trace to the trips listed under pickup_dropoff_restrictions_that_matter. Fix: in build_transit.py drop a trip's leading stop_times while pickup_type = 1 (exact when the restriction is at the first stop, which is the only case here)."
 },
